  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tailor-made Training on Justice 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this tailor-made training (TMT) is to improve the knowledge, skills and capabilities of women working in the justice sector by sharing knowledge, experiences and expertise on various topics.The training will have a positive impact on women&apos;s abilities and efficiency at work and it will increase their opportunities (to reach to decision making positions).Last but not least, the course also aims at strengthening participants&apos; ties with the Netherlands and the Dutch government.RemarkDue to the transparency with regard to the IATI projects, a non-ODA country has been included in this project.</narrative>
  </description>
